(Control-plane transaction flow) title
(The most mature architectural idea is that durable state, audit event, and idempotency response commit together.) subtitle
(Admission sequence) h
54 602 105 40 0.90 0.95 1 box 106 626 (Human reviews) ct 106 614 (snapshot + plan) ct
179 602 105 40 0.88 0.97 0.95 box 231 626 (Control checks) ct 231 614 (scope + limits) ct
