(ProviderDisabledCoordinator assembles a recap, status, and human_review_needed proposal; each proposal) t
(has provider_disabled=true and authority_effect=none. Human registration can turn a reviewed proposal) t
(into an experiment design only; it creates no approval, grant, dispatch, result, or conclusion.) t
