(allowlisted. It returns control-record operation status and scientific_validity=not_assessed.) t
(The result is compared to current control data, stored with argument/result digests, observed time and) t
(deterministic provider-disabled provenance, then rendered as an attributed answer. If acknowledgement is) t
(lost after intent, the persisted intent prevents a second facade invocation. Expiry, cancellation, stale) t
(design context, wrong credential/agent, or changed binding fail closed.) t
rule
(Authority boundary) h
(The agent facade forbids approve, grant, dispatch, provision, secret, shell, accept_result, publish, and) t
(skill loading. It has no generic HTTP method, control-store import, provider/model client, harness, MCP,) t
(or runtime-skill loader. Explain-status is operational description only: it neither mutates experiment) t
(state nor converts an observed operation into provider success or scientific validity.) t
